Package: atRutils
Title: Shared Data-Management Utilities for ATR Consulting
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Khaibar", "Omari", , "khaibar.omari@atr-consulting.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of data-management helpers used across ATR
    Consulting projects. Provides tolerant parsing and cleaning routines for
    the heterogeneous data that arrives from survey platforms, spreadsheets
    and partner systems, starting with date and date-time coercion that
    handles mixed formats, Excel serial numbers and Unix timestamps in a
    single vector.
